{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。解脱与失落并存、对过去的眷恋以及对未来缺乏安全感，都与完整稿一致。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。怀念自在生活、害怕忘记离开的原因，以及不甘心连快乐回忆也失去，均准确对应。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。怨气、曾被接纳的温暖、短暂快乐以及对离开是否更好的怀疑，都拼对了。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。渴望重新亲近、委屈被唤起、反思离开决定和反复设想另一种可能，均准确。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。既不愿忍受委屈，也不愿否认快乐回忆，最终因无法继续相伴而难过，理解准确。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"将温暖和难过缓解进一步概括成了安心，弱化了完整稿中隔着玻璃般的疏离感、对遥远家园的凝望，以及珍惜之物无法挽回的失落。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"基本理解了孤独与不愿再次受委屈的冲突，但把找不回当初离开决心这一具体处境泛化成了普通的动摇。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。暂时搁置回去的念头、想起接纳带来的温暖，以及对未来独自面对困难的不安，均准确。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。分不清怀念接纳还是害怕孤独，甚至可能愿意再次忍受委屈，准确抓住了这一屏的核心矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。最舍不得被当作自己人的感觉，同时又无法忘记受过的气，因此仅凭想念不敢回去，完全对应。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。认识到回去未必恢复亲近，不愿仅凭希望再次忍让，决定先过稳眼下生活，同时不收回离开打算，理解准确。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把情绪概括成平和，稍微软化了完整稿中昂扬、宣告式的坚定和重新决定如何站立的力量感；也没有充分体现带着想念继续生活的主动性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。重新向往自然亲近的关系、恢复生活动力、接受等待可能很久甚至没有知心人的现实，仍愿意好好生活，主旨一致。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 4,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲故事一致：他离开曾经亲近却也让自己受过委屈的生活，在怀念、孤独与动摇中反复审视自己的选择，最终既不否认过去的快乐，也不收回离开的决定，而是带着想念继续生活并期待未来。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2bc01db8-6cfe-4bfe-9aa2-eedd582eadb3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T035945135470Z", "elapsed_seconds": 62.579, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T04:00:47.720377+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "854fa583880a01154f01cbb0f2558ad8b7293884b9cc2c154e23b1eb653649e4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T035945135470Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "3fc4b2982c9d5d48a727875fa7b1e7a5228d0a480c58318dd851d408c0ab8bb7"}}}
